$(i-0.5)^2 + (j-0.5)^2 = i^2 - i + 0.25 + j^2 - j + 0.25 = i^2 + j^2 - i - j + 0.5$.

The maximum distance squared among these four vertices is $\max((i+0.5)^2 + (j+0.5)^2, (i+0.5)^2 + (j-0.5)^2, (i-0.5)^2 + (j+0.5)^2, (i-0.5)^2 + (j-0.5)^2)$.
