$(i+0.5)^2 + (j-0.5)^2 = i^2 + j^2 + i - j + 0.5$.
$(i-0.5)^2 + (j+0.5)^2 = i^2 + j^2 - i + j + 0.5$.
$(i-0.5)^2 + (j-0.5)^2 = i^2 + j^2 - i - j + 0.5$.

The condition is that the maximum of these values is $\le R^2$.
So, $i^2 + j^2 + \max(i+j, i-j, -i+j, -i-j) + 0.5 \le R^2$.
